{"version": 2, "width": 128, "height": 26, "timestamp": 1792082892, "title": "Hoist: the walkthrough", "env": {"SHELL": "/bin/bash", "TERM": "xterm-256color"}, "hoist": {"version": "hoist 0.1.0", "script": "brand/video/walkthrough/script.sh", "note": "The capture's working directory was HOME, and its paths are shown under /home/me; the binaries were copied into its .cargo/bin."}}
[0.2858, "m", "{\"step\": \"Check the install\"}"]
[0.3043, "m", "{\"caption\": \"hoist doctor checks the binaries on PATH and ~/.hoist, and says what a key would add. Nothing here needs one.\"}"]
[0.3222, "m", "{\"cmd\": \"hoist doctor\"}"]
[0.3599, "o", "hoist 0.1.0 (/home/me/.cargo/bin/hoist)\r\n\r\n"]
[0.4146, "o", "ok       hoist-mcp 0.1.0 (/home/me/.cargo/bin/hoist-mcp)\r\nok       hoist-procedure 0.1.0 (/home/me/.cargo/bin/hoist-procedure)\r\nok       hoist-mcp-demo 0.1.0 (/home/me/.cargo/bin/hoist-mcp-demo)\r\nnote     /home/me/.hoist does not exist yet; `hoist-mcp --record` creates it\r\nnote     TYPESAFE_API_KEY is not set. It is optional: recording, `learn --habit-only`, `flow-show`, `flow-diff`, `audit`, `promote` and serving with `--flow-decider habit` or `reach` need no key. With one, hoist asks TypeSafe's Jev: `learn` fits an arbiter, the proxy serves with `--flow-decider arbiter` and runs the confirmation judge, and `phase0 --oracle jev` measures Jev on τ²-bench.\r\nnote     no flows in ~/.hoist yet (`hoist learn` writes one)\r\nnote     no recorded sessions in ~/.hoist yet\r\n"]
[0.4366, "m", "{\"exit\": 0}"]
[0.4551, "m", "{\"step\": \"Wrap the server\"}"]
[0.4727, "m", "{\"caption\": \"A folder of notes, served by the official MCP filesystem server. hoist init prints the host's configuration: for Claude Code, a claude mcp add command that puts hoist-mcp in the server's place.\"}"]
[0.4902, "m", "{\"cmd\": \"find notes -type f | sort\"}"]
[0.5138, "o", "notes/inbox/receipt.txt\r\n"]
[0.5139, "o", "notes/meetings/2026-08-18.md\r\nnotes/meetings/2026-08-25.md\r\nnotes/meetings/2026-09-01.md\r\nnotes/meetings/2026-09-08.md\r\nnotes/meetings/2026-09-15.md\r\nnotes/meetings/2026-10-06.md\r\nnotes/meetings/2026-10-13.md\r\nnotes/projects/alpha.md\r\nnotes/projects/beta.md\r\nnotes/projects/delta.md\r\nnotes/projects/gamma.md\r\nnotes/todo.md\r\n"]
[0.5327, "m", "{\"exit\": 0}"]
[0.5501, "m", "{\"caption\": \"Its next steps go to stderr; the rest of this walkthrough runs them. A scripted agent starts the proxy with the same arguments.\"}"]
[0.5669, "m", "{\"cmd\": \"hoist init --host claude-code --domain notes -- npx -y @modelcontextprotocol/server-filesystem ~/notes 2>/dev/null\"}"]
[0.6079, "o", "claude mcp add notes -- hoist-mcp --record ~/.hoist/logs/notes --domain notes -- npx -y @modelcontextprotocol/server-filesystem /home/me/notes\r\n"]
[0.6281, "m", "{\"exit\": 0}"]
[0.6447, "m", "{\"step\": \"Record sessions\"}"]
[0.6614, "m", "{\"caption\": \"Use the agent as usual. Here a scripted agent stands in for the LLM: it searches the notes and reads what it finds, through the proxy, which records each session in ~/.hoist/logs/notes.\"}"]
[0.6781, "m", "{\"cmd\": \"./agent --quiet --from recorded.txt\"}"]
[5.9276, "o", "What's the status of project alpha?            2 calls\r\n"]
[7.8485, "o", "Summarize the September meetings.              4 calls\r\n"]
[9.6628, "o", "What's left on my todo list?                   2 calls\r\n"]
[11.4307, "o", "Compare projects beta and gamma.               3 calls\r\n"]
[13.1233, "o", "What did we decide on September 8?             2 calls\r\n"]
[15.0224, "o", "Read me all my project notes.                  5 calls\r\n"]
[16.7851, "o", "Summarize the August meetings.                 3 calls\r\n"]
[18.4414, "o", "What's in my inbox?                            1 call\r\n"]
[18.4673, "m", "{\"exit\": 0}"]
[18.4843, "m", "{\"cmd\": \"ls ~/.hoist/logs/notes\"}"]
[18.502, "o", "20261015T164743.182Z-311.jsonl\t20261015T164750.225Z-365.jsonl\t20261015T164753.803Z-419.jsonl\t20261015T164757.396Z-473.jsonl\r\n20261015T164748.302Z-338.jsonl\t20261015T164752.037Z-392.jsonl\t20261015T164755.497Z-446.jsonl\t20261015T164759.158Z-500.jsonl\r\n"]
[18.5199, "m", "{\"exit\": 0}"]
[18.5373, "m", "{\"step\": \"Learn a flow, with no key\"}"]
[18.5542, "m", "{\"caption\": \"--habit-only asks no model: Hoist counts which reads followed which calls, and where their arguments came from.\"}"]
[18.5711, "m", "{\"cmd\": \"hoist learn --sessions ~/.hoist/logs/notes --domain notes --habit-only --out ~/.hoist/notes.flow.json\"}"]
[18.6861, "o", "hoist: learned the notes"]
[18.6862, "o", " flow from "]
[18.6863, "o", "8 sessions (14 tools) and wrote "]
[18.6864, "o", "/home/me/.hoist/notes.flow.json\r\n"]
[18.7066, "m", "{\"exit\": 0}"]
[18.7229, "m", "{\"step\": \"Review it\"}"]
[18.7396, "m", "{\"caption\": \"A flow is a JSON file to review before serving it. flow-show renders it for a reviewer: what it may look up after each call, and where each argument comes from.\"}"]
[18.7579, "m", "{\"caption\": \"After a search, the flow reads a file: the agent did so after every search in training.\"}"]
[18.7756, "m", "{\"cmd\": \"hoist flow-show ~/.hoist/notes.flow.json | awk '/^## Sites/{on=1} /^## Bindings/{on=0} on'\"}"]
[18.8495, "o", "## Sites\r\n"]
[18.8495, "o", "\r\nAfter each call: the lookups the flow may make next, what the agent did next in training, and what the flow does there with `reach` at a threshold of 0.3, which is the likeliest lookup's share of the times the agent made it before its next write, times the chance its bound arguments are the agent's. The share pools over the calls before and the code features, so a live decision near the threshold can go either way.\r\n\r\n| After | Lookups it may make next (times seen) | What the agent did next in training | With `reach` |\r\n|---|---|---|---|\r\n| `read_text_file` | `read_text_file` (7) | read_text_file 50%, respond 50% (of 14) | looks up `read_text_file` 0.50 × 0.81 = 0.41 |\r\n| `search_files` | `read_text_file` (7) | read_text_file 100% (of 7) | looks up `read_text_file` 1.00 × 0.81 = 0.81 |\r\n\r\n"]
[18.8699, "m", "{\"exit\": 0}"]
[18.8894, "m", "{\"caption\": \"The file's path comes from the search's own result: one line of it, or all of it when it found one file.\"}"]
[18.9132, "m", "{\"cmd\": \"hoist flow-show ~/.hoist/notes.flow.json | awk '/^## Bindings/{on=1} /^## Sources/{on=0} on'\"}"]
[18.9887, "o", "## Bindings\r\n\r\nWhere each lookup's required arguments come from, and how often binding them that way gave the agent's own arguments in training, when the customer had not mentioned the values and when they had. With nothing tried, the chance is 1/2.\r\n\r\n| Lookup | Argument | Bound from (values found there, of the values it took) | Chance it is the agent's (right/tried): not mentioned, mentioned |\r\n|---|---|---|---|\r\n| `list_directory` | `path` | nothing: the flow never makes this lookup | — |\r\n| `read_text_file` | `path` | `search_files` at `$` (3 of 14); `search_files` at `$[*]` (11 of 14) | 0.81 (12/14), 0.50 (0/0) |\r\n| `search_files` | `path` | nothing: the flow never makes this lookup | — |\r\n| `search_files` | `pattern` | nothing: the flow never makes this lookup | — |\r\n\r\n"]
[19.0078, "m", "{\"exit\": 0}"]
[19.031, "m", "{\"step\": \"Audit it on sessions it never saw\"}"]
[19.0528, "m", "{\"caption\": \"Record three more sessions without the flow, then score the agent's steps under it, site by site.\"}"]
[19.0723, "m", "{\"cmd\": \"./agent --quiet --logs ~/.hoist/logs/notes-new --from new.txt\"}"]
[20.9639, "o", "What's the status of project gamma?            2 calls\r\n"]
[22.7381, "o", "Summarize the August and September meetings.   6 calls\r\n"]
[24.4976, "o", "What's in my inbox?                            1 call\r\n"]
[24.5248, "m", "{\"exit\": 0}"]
[24.5447, "m", "{\"cmd\": \"hoist audit --flow ~/.hoist/notes.flow.json --sessions ~/.hoist/logs/notes-new | head -n 14\"}"]
[24.6215, "o", "hoist: audited 4 decisions in 3 episodes in "]
[24.6216, "o", "0.0 s\r\n"]
[24.6233, "o", "# Flow audit: notes\r\n\r\nThe flow decides with the habit alone. 3 episodes, 4 decisions scored (0 left out: no answer from the oracle).\r\n\r\n- **Agreement:** the flow's likeliest option was the agent's step at 75.0% of decisions (74.6% expected if it picked at random from its own probabilities).\r\n- **Surprise:** 0.355 nats per decision (the agent's path has log-probability -1.4 under the flow, scored by fugue's `ScoreGivenTrace`).\r\n- **Calibration:** expected calibration error 0.038.\r\n\r\n## Sites\r\n\r\n| Site | Decisions | Agreement | Nats per decision |\r\n|---|---|---|---|\r\n| `read_text_file` | 2 | 50.0% | 0.701 |\r\n| `search_files` | 2 | 100.0% | 0.009 |\r\n"]
[24.6436, "m", "{\"exit\": 0}"]
[24.6605, "m", "{\"step\": \"Serve it\"}"]
[24.6778, "m", "{\"caption\": \"The same request, without the flow and with it. With it, the flow's reads ride in the search's result, and the agent skips the calls it would have made.\"}"]
[24.695, "m", "{\"cmd\": \"./agent --logs ~/.hoist/logs/served \\\"Summarize the October meetings.\\\"\"}"]
[28.0431, "o", "customer: Summarize the October meetings.\r\n"]
[28.0643, "o", "  → search_files {\"path\": \"/home/me/notes\", \"pattern\": \"**/meetings/2026-10-*.md\"}\r\n  ← /home/me/notes/meetings/2026-10-06.md\r\n    /home/me/notes/meetings/2026-10-13.md\r\n"]
[28.0677, "o", "  → read_text_file {\"path\": \"/home/me/notes/meetings/2026-10-06.md\"}\r\n  ← # 2026-10-06\r\n    Gamma design review moved to 10-09.\r\n"]
[28.0701, "o", "  → read_text_file {\"path\": \"/home/me/notes/meetings/2026-10-13.md\"}\r\n  ← # 2026-10-13\r\n    Delta owner: Priya.\r\n"]
[28.1103, "o", "agent: Gamma design review moved to 10-09. Delta owner: Priya.\r\n3 calls\r\n"]
[28.1392, "m", "{\"exit\": 0}"]
[28.1558, "m", "{\"caption\": \"With the flow, served by the proxy behind the agent's calls: --flow ~/.hoist/notes.flow.json. It has no arbiter, so the proxy decides with reach, asking no model.\"}"]
[28.1728, "m", "{\"cmd\": \"./agent --logs ~/.hoist/logs/served --flow ~/.hoist/notes.flow.json \\\"Summarize the October meetings.\\\"\"}"]
[30.0734, "o", "customer: Summarize the October meetings.\r\n"]
[30.1204, "o", "  → search_files {\"path\": \"/home/me/notes\", \"pattern\": \"**/meetings/2026-10-*.md\"}\r\n  ← /home/me/notes/meetings/2026-10-06.md\r\n    /home/me/notes/meetings/2026-10-13.md\r\n    --- Also looked up automatically (current results; no need to repeat these calls) ---\r\n    \r\n    read_text_file {\"path\":\"/home/me/notes/meetings/2026-10-06.md\"}:\r\n    # 2026-10-06\r\n    Gamma design review moved to 10-09.\r\n    \r\n    \r\n    read_text_file {\"path\":\"/home/me/notes/meetings/2026-10-13.md\"}:\r\n"]
[30.1205, "o", "    # 2026-10-13\r\n    Delta owner: Priya.\r\n"]
[30.163, "o", "agent: Gamma design review moved to 10-09. Delta owner: Priya.\r\n1 call; the flow read 2 files for it\r\n"]
[30.1894, "m", "{\"exit\": 0}"]
[30.2066, "m", "{\"caption\": \"The flow log says why: each lookup's probability and its binding's chance, then why it handed back.\"}"]
[30.2238, "m", "{\"cmd\": \"jq -c 'select(.action) | {action, site, prob: (.prob * 100 | round / 100), binding, tool, reason} | del(..|nulls)' ~/.hoist/logs/served/*.flow.jsonl\"}"]
[30.2523, "o", "\u001b[1;39m{\u001b[0m\u001b[1;34m\"action\"\u001b[0m\u001b[1;39m:\u001b[0m\u001b[0;32m\"lookup\"\u001b[0m\u001b[1;39m,\u001b[0m\u001b[1;34m\"site\"\u001b[0m\u001b[1;39m:\u001b[0m\u001b[0;32m\"search_files\"\u001b[0m\u001b[1;39m,\u001b[0m\u001b[1;34m\"prob\"\u001b[0m\u001b[1;39m:\u001b[0m\u001b[0;39m0.98\u001b[0m\u001b[1;39m,\u001b[0m\u001b[1;34m\"binding\"\u001b[0m\u001b[1;39m:\u001b[0m\u001b[0;39m0.8125\u001b[0m\u001b[1;39m,\u001b[0m\u001b[1;34m\"tool\"\u001b[0m\u001b[1;39m:\u001b[0m\u001b[0;32m\"read_text_file\"\u001b[0m\u001b[1;39m\u001b[1;39m}\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[30.2525, "o", "\u001b[1;39m{\u001b[0m\u001b[1;34m\"action\"\u001b[0m\u001b[1;39m:\u001b[0m\u001b[0;32m\"lookup\"\u001b[0m\u001b[1;39m,\u001b[0m\u001b[1;34m\"site\"\u001b[0m\u001b[1;39m:\u001b[0m\u001b[0;32m\"read_text_file\"\u001b[0m\u001b[1;39m,\u001b[0m\u001b[1;34m\"prob\"\u001b[0m\u001b[1;39m:\u001b[0m\u001b[0;39m0.56\u001b[0m\u001b[1;39m,\u001b[0m\u001b[1;34m\"binding\"\u001b[0m\u001b[1;39m:\u001b[0m\u001b[0;39m0.8125\u001b[0m\u001b[1;39m,\u001b[0m\u001b[1;34m\"tool\"\u001b[0m\u001b[1;39m:\u001b[0m\u001b[0;32m\"read_text_file\"\u001b[0m\u001b[1;39m\u001b[1;39m}\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[30.2525, "o", "\u001b[1;39m{\u001b[0m\u001b[1;34m\"action\"\u001b[0m\u001b[1;39m:\u001b[0m\u001b[0;32m\"hand_back\"\u001b[0m\u001b[1;39m,\u001b[0m\u001b[1;34m\"site\"\u001b[0m\u001b[1;39m:\u001b[0m\u001b[0;32m\"read_text_file\"\u001b[0m\u001b[1;39m,\u001b[0m\u001b[1;34m\"prob\"\u001b[0m\u001b[1;39m:\u001b[0m\u001b[0;39m0.45\u001b[0m\u001b[1;39m,\u001b[0m\u001b[1;34m\"reason\"\u001b[0m\u001b[1;39m:\u001b[0m\u001b[0;32m\"read_text_file: nothing left to pass as `path`\"\u001b[0m\u001b[1;39m\u001b[1;39m}\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[30.2707, "m", "{\"exit\": 0}"]
[30.288, "m", "{\"step\": \"Learn again, and review what changed\"}"]
[30.3054, "m", "{\"caption\": \"The audit's sessions are new training data. Learn from all eleven, and diff the new flow against the one being served.\"}"]
[30.3223, "m", "{\"cmd\": \"cp ~/.hoist/logs/notes-new/*.jsonl ~/.hoist/logs/notes/\"}"]
[30.3556, "m", "{\"exit\": 0}"]
[30.3728, "m", "{\"cmd\": \"hoist learn --sessions ~/.hoist/logs/notes --domain notes --habit-only --out ~/.hoist/notes-2.flow.json\"}"]
[30.4975, "o", "hoist: learned the notes flow from "]
[30.4975, "o", "11 sessions (14 tools) and wrote "]
[30.4976, "o", "/home/me/.hoist/notes-2.flow.json\r\n"]
[30.519, "m", "{\"exit\": 0}"]
[30.537, "m", "{\"cmd\": \"hoist flow-diff ~/.hoist/notes.flow.json ~/.hoist/notes-2.flow.json\"}"]
[30.6028, "o", "# Flow diff: notes\r\n\r\nNothing needs review: the flow runs the same program, and calls no tool, makes no lookup, binds no argument and asks no model or question it did not before.\r\n\r\n## What the agent did next in training\r\n\r\n- after `read_text_file`: read_text_file 50% → 55%\r\n\r\n## Bindings\r\n\r\n- `read_text_file`'s chance (not mentioned): 0.81 → 0.86\r\n\r\n## Provenance\r\n\r\n- the habit learned from 8 → 11 successful sessions or episodes\r\n"]
[30.624, "m", "{\"exit\": 0}"]
